# Counter & Shop Helper: what never goes to GitHub.

# --- Signing keys, API tokens, secrets (never commit, never share) ------------------------------
# The Tempest signing key lives in %USERPROFILE%\.tempest-keys\, outside this repository.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.kdbx
.tempest-keys/
*.token
*token*.txt
*secret*
.env
.env.*
credentials*.json

# --- Build output: signed .tempest packages go to GitHub Releases, not into git ------------------
dist/
*.tempest
*.zip
*.7z

# --- Python caches and environments ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Game files and local workspaces (extracted game data, SDK dumps, logs) -----------------------
# The mod ships and versions no game art and no game text: names are asked from the running game,
# engine/game_ids_8_1.json holds message ids only.
Work/
Extracted/
types/sdk/
src/icons/
*.upk
*.dat
*.tfc
*.dds
*.swf
*.gfx
*.log

# --- Temporary and editor / OS files --------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
~$*
.idea/
.vs/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
